  "id": "m8-gen9-doubles-two-lightning-rods-tied-the-earlier-started-takes-it",
  "notes": [
    "Gen 9 doubles, minimized from Nightly 158's m8-gen9-doubles-s1512-006. Latios transformed into Geodude (Lightning Rod), so two Lightning Rods stand at the same Speed (Transform copies the stats). Hippopotas's Electro Drift is aimed at Geodude: Showdown's `priorityEvent('RedirectTarget')` sorts the handlers by priority, then speed, then the holder's `abilityState.effectOrder` (`compareRedirectOrder`), and the first that names a target decides. Geodude's ability state started before Latios's (the Transform started a new one), so Geodude keeps the move itself and Latios's handler never runs (DESIGN.md R-M8-182)."
  ],
